 "title": "漏写一条",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 108.77,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "电路最常见的漏洞，叫约束不足。",
   "spoken": "电路最常见的漏洞，叫约束不足。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.96,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.721
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "某个值被算出来了，却没有被约束。",
   "spoken": "某个值被算出来了，却没有被约束。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.78,
   "dur": 3.336,
   "speechStart": 5.878,
   "speechEnd": 8.294
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "在 Circom 语言里，有一种写法只赋值，不约束。另一种写法，赋值的同时加上约束。",
   "spoken": "在 Circom 语言里，有一种写法只赋值，不约束。另一种写法，赋值的同时加上约束。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-02.mp3",
   "start": 9.336,
   "dur": 7.872,
   "speechStart": 9.434,
   "speechEnd": 16.36
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "只用了前一种写法的信号，恶意证明者可以填任何值。",
   "spoken": "只用了前一种写法的信号，恶意证明者可以填任何值。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-03.mp3",
   "start": 17.428,
   "dur": 5.136,
   "speechStart": 17.526,
   "speechEnd": 21.74
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "看一个玩具例子。账户余额是 20，有人要提款 25。",
   "spoken": "看一个玩具例子。账户余额是 20，有人要提款 25。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-04.mp3",
   "start": 22.784,
   "dur": 5.424,
   "speechStart": 22.882,
   "speechEnd": 27.367
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "电路要求，新余额拆成 5 个二进制位，每一位只能是 0 或 1。",
   "spoken": "电路要求，新余额拆成 5 个二进制位，每一位只能是 0 或 1。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-05.mp3",
   "start": 28.428,
   "dur": 5.88,
   "speechStart": 28.526,
   "speechEnd": 33.478
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "只去掉最高位的这一条，恶意证明者就把最高位填成 30。",
   "spoken": "只去掉最高位的这一条，恶意证明者就把最高位填成 30。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-06.mp3",
   "start": 34.528,
   "dur": 5.184,
   "speechStart": 34.626,
   "speechEnd": 38.864
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "电路里的数，算到一个上限就绕回去。填 30 之后，等式照样成立。",
   "spoken": "电路里的数，算到一个上限就绕回去。填 30 之后，等式照样成立。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-07.mp3",
   "start": 39.932,
   "dur": 6.792,
   "speechStart": 40.03,
   "speechEnd": 45.872
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "余额检查被绕过，提款 25 通过了验证。",
   "spoken": "余额检查被绕过，提款 25 通过了验证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-08.mp3",
   "start": 46.944,
   "dur": 4.008,
   "speechStart": 47.042,
   "speechEnd": 50.113
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "反过来，约束写得太严，叫过度约束。",
   "spoken": "反过来，约束写得太严，叫过度约束。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-09.mp3",
   "start": 51.172,
   "dur": 4.2,
   "speechStart": 51.27,
   "speechEnd": 54.52
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "合法的输入也无法生成证明，结果是拒绝服务，资金可能被锁住。",
   "spoken": "合法的输入也无法生成证明，结果是拒绝服务，资金可能被锁住。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-10.mp3",
   "start": 55.592,
   "dur": 6.576,
   "speechStart": 55.69,
   "speechEnd": 61.332
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "真实的例子在 2019 年。",
   "spoken": "真实的例子在 2019 年。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-11.mp3",
   "start": 62.388,
   "dur": 2.928,
   "speechStart": 62.486,
   "speechEnd": 64.486
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "按 Trail of Bits 的介绍，Tornado Cash 用的一个哈希实现里，有一个输出只被赋值，没有被约束。",
   "spoken": "按 Trail of Bits 的介绍，Tornado Cash 用的一个哈希实现里，有一个输出只被赋值，没有被约束。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-12.mp3",
   "start": 65.536,
   "dur": 7.488,
   "speechStart": 65.634,
   "speechEnd": 72.193
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "攻击者本可以伪造 Merkle 根，取走别人的资金。",
   "spoken": "攻击者本可以伪造 Merkle 根，取走别人的资金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-13.mp3",
   "start": 73.244,
   "dur": 4.416,
   "speechStart": 73.342,
   "speechEnd": 76.818
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "团队发现后，抢先利用这个漏洞，把资金转走保护起来，再修复。",
   "spoken": "团队发现后，抢先利用这个漏洞，把资金转走保护起来，再修复。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-14.mp3",
   "start": 77.88,
   "dur": 6.024,
   "speechStart": 77.978,
   "speechEnd": 83.073
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "没有资金被盗。",
   "spoken": "没有资金被盗。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-15.mp3",
   "start": 84.124,
   "dur": 2.064,
   "speechStart": 84.222,
   "speechEnd": 85.353
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "同类问题很多。0xPARC 维护的公开漏洞清单里，收录了大量这样的例子。",
   "spoken": "同类问题很多。0xPARC 维护的公开漏洞清单里，收录了大量这样的例子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-16.mp3",
   "start": 86.408,
   "dur": 6.768,
   "speechStart": 86.506,
   "speechEnd": 92.325
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "防御有三条。",
   "spoken": "防御有三条。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-17.mp3",
   "start": 93.396,
   "dur": 2.064,
   "speechStart": 93.494,
   "speechEnd": 94.625
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "用静态分析工具，找出没有约束的信号。",
   "spoken": "用静态分析工具，找出没有约束的信号。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-18.mp3",
   "start": 95.68,
   "dur": 3.792,
   "speechStart": 95.778,
   "speechEnd": 98.623
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "关键电路，做形式化验证。",
   "spoken": "关键电路，做形式化验证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-19.mp3",
   "start": 99.692,
   "dur": 3.216,
   "speechStart": 99.79,
   "speechEnd": 102.075
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "每条约束写正反两种测试，恶意的输入也要测。",
   "spoken": "每条约束写正反两种测试，恶意的输入也要测。",
